["kārikā śrī(jñānā)khyātaṃ visarja jñānakārikā(m)", "sāmprataṃ kathayiṣyāmi yogināṃ yuktakāraṇam", "pañcapañcavinirmukto............varjitam", "sarvavyā(dhi)vinirmuktaṃ yacca indriyagocara(m)", "dvādaśāntaṃ kalāśataṃ varṇākṣaravivarjitam", "brahmā viṣṇustathā rudra īśvaraḥ śiva eva ca", "rūpakāyaḥ sadātītaṃ mantratantrāvivarjitam", "sākulatvaṃ yadā cittaṃ viṣayāsaktacetasām", "etaddvandvasamākhyātaṃ saṃsārasya tu nirṇayam", "yena vijñānamātreṇa muktirbhavati yoginām", "niścitaṃ niścalaṃ sāmyaṃ nirdvandvaṃ ca nirākulam", "niścittaṃ cittarahitaṃ kārikājñānamuttamam", "sarvāśrayavinirmuktaṃ cittāścai(va) nirāśrayam", "devo devī tathānyañca dharmādharmavivarjitam", "āśrayaṃ bandhamityuktaṃ muktiścaiva nirāśrayam", "viṣayāvasthaṃ yadā cittaṃ dvandvamuktivivarjita(m)", "kathantaṃ niścalaṃ devi jñātavyaṃ jñānakārike", "kārikātattvasadbhāvaṃ siddhanāthakulodbhavam", "pṛthivyāpastaṃ tathā yogī vāyurākāśameva ca", "sarveṣāṃ vyāpakaḥ śānta vyāptī tasya na vidyate", "kathitaṃ tattvabhirvastu jñānaratnaṃ sudurlabham", "sāttvikantu tṛtīyañca tribhirdharmeṇa lakṣaṇam", "sāttvikaṃ tṛtīyaṃ jñeyaṃ dharmayuktaṃ sadā sthitam", "guṇatrayavinirmuktaṃ sadā nirvāṇalakṣaṇam", "sarvāgnivinayātītamindriyātītamavyayam", "cittābhāvavinirmuktaṃ nimittaṃ tattvalaukikam", "cittādyacintitaṃ jñānamavācyajñānanirṇayam", "cañcalaṃ bhāvamityuktamacalaṃ muktilakṣaṇam", "cittātītaṃ yadā cittaṃ niścitamacalaṃ bhavet", "na yogādhyātacittastu na ca lakṣaṇasādhakam", "na bahirantamantasthaṃ na cānta ādimadhyagaḥ", "na buddhirna cāhaṃkāro na mana indriyo na ca", "na cintā yastu vijñeyā jñātavya kālaśāsanaḥ", "jñātavyaṃ mokṣasadbhāvaṃ guptabhedaprakāśitam", "nirvikalpaṃ sadā jñānaṃ kathitaṃ jñānakārikam", "dhāraṇādharavinyāsacandrasūryāgnimaṇḍale", "sarve te kalpanā proktaṃ nirvikalpastathānyathā", "paripūrṇaṃ kathaṃ teṣāṃ siddhakramavivarjitam", "na yānti ceha saṃsāre ye sthitā uttamaṃ padam", "pāśadvayavinirūpastu dharmādharmanibandhane", "andhapāśaṃ yadā cittaṃ kuto gacchanti yoginaḥ", "tena pāśena baddhastu bhuñjate karmasañcayam", "dharmādharmau tu dvau yo'sau trailokyasya nibandhanam", "dharmā caiva adharmā dvau dvividhaṃ parikīrtitam", "adhyātmajātasadbhāvaṃ yogināmevasaṃsthitaḥ", "ādhyātmike caiva dharmādharmasthitiḥ sadā", "dharmādharmakṣaye kṣīṇe mucyate sarvairdhanaiḥ (?)", "dharmādharmavicāro'yaṃ kathitaṃ jñānakārikaiḥ", "sa cetājñāna na sarvaḥ caitanyaṃ jñānavarjitam", "bhuktitattvaṃ yadā cetaṃ sa cettammuktilakṣaṇam", "yogināṃ yogacintitamāryasaṃjñānavarjitam", "ekaliṅge śmaśāne vā nadīnāṃ saṅgameṣu ca", "mahodadhitaṭe caiva tripathe vāpi sādhakaḥ", "mālānirmālitā yogī ekākī bhramate sadā", "layapūjāṣṭakaṃ yattaṃ liṅgantu sa carācaram", "etat kaulikaṃ yalliṅgaṃ na śailahemaraupyajam", "ekaliṅgaṃ samākhyātaṃ śmaśānaṃ kathayāmi te", "nisvāsasvāsasaṃyuktaṃ śmaśānaṃ parikīrtitam", "aśarīraṃ yadā tattvaṃ svadehe sā sthitā yadi", "guhyaṃ tu kathayiṣyāmi guhye sacarācaram", "guhyāvāsaṃ sthito yogī caryā tasya na ucyate", "vṛkṣaḥ śarīramityuktaṃ pādādikaraśākhayoḥ", "vṛkṣamūlaṃ tato jñātvā bāhyavṛkṣasya varjitam", "jayā ca vijayā caiva ajitā cāparājitā", "catvāraṃ kathitaṃ divyaṃ mahodadhitaṭaḥ śṛṇu", "binducārusthitā nityaṃ taṭasthaṃ bindumaṇḍalam", "candraṃ tyaktvā yadā yāti ādhāraṃ sūryamaṇḍalam", "gaganamāsthito (?) nityaṃ velā iva mahodadheḥ", "nāsthiraṃ bhavati śvāsaṃ bahisthaṃ manarañjitam", "pravāhaṃ gamanañcaiva gamanāgamanaṃ punaḥ", "gamāgama yathā velā nāsti rañjita kaścit (?)", "mahodadhitaṭe sthitvā udadhi kathitaṃ tataḥ", "yogināṃ caryasadbhāvaṃ kathitaṃ tattvaṃ viśeṣataḥ", "sattvarajastamaścaiva ekatve tu yathā sthitam", "tripathaṃ tu samākhyātaṃ nagnantu kathayāmi te", "nagnastu kathitān devān muktakeśantataḥ śṛṇu", "dharmastu naikena pāśaścaiva viśeṣataḥ", "muktakeśaḥ samākhyāta ānandaṃ śṛṇu sāmpratam", "pānayogāmṛtaṃ divyaṃ yogināṃ samprakīrtitam", "madirānandamākhyātaṃ nairmālyamālino (?) śṛṇu", "nairmālyamālino yogī yogacaryāṃ karoti saḥ", "asaṃhāyo bhramate dhīraḥ sa ekākīnamucyate", "etaccaryā samākhyātā viśa ca jñānadhāraka (?)"]